<navigation-bar title="近7日奶量趋势" back="{{false}}" color="#332724" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack">‹</view></navigation-bar><view class="page-shell"><view wx:if="{{reviewLabel}}" class="review">{{reviewLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="sub">正在整理奶量记录…</view><view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="card error">{{errorMessage}}<button class="button" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><block wx:elif="{{!loading}}"><text class="eyebrow">{{startDate}} — {{endDate}}</text><view class="card"><view class="heading">每日奶量<text class="unit">毫升</text></view><view class="milk-stat-grid"><view><text class="sub">已知量合计</text><text class="stat">{{totalText}}</text></view><view><text class="sub">日均已知量</text><text class="stat">{{averageText}}</text></view><view><text class="sub">有量记录</text><text class="stat">{{knownDays}} 天</text></view><view><text class="sub">喂养记录</text><text class="stat">{{feedCount}} 次</text></view></view><text class="sub">{{knownDays?'日均按'+knownDays+'天有量记录计算，未记录日不当作0。':'没有已知奶量，日均保持未知。'}}{{unknownCount?'另有'+unknownCount+'次未记录奶量。':''}}</text><text wx:if="{{!knownDays}}" class="sub">本周期没有已知奶量，喂养事件仍可按日期查看。</text><view wx:if="{{knownDays}}" class="chart"><view class="axis"><text wx:for="{{axis}}" wx:key="key" class="axis-label" style="bottom:{{item.bottom}}%">{{item.text}}</text></view><view class="plot"><view wx:for="{{ticks}}" wx:key="key" class="grid-line" style="bottom:{{item.bottom}}%"></view><view class="columns"><view wx:for="{{bars}}" wx:key="date" class="column" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="selectDay"><text class="bar-value" style="bottom:{{item.height}}%;margin-bottom:8rpx">{{item.valueText}}</text><view class="bar {{item.estimated?'estimated':''}} {{item.date===selectedDate?'selected':''}}" style="height:{{item.height}}%"></view></view></view></view></view><view class="dates"><text wx:for="{{bars}}" wx:key="date" class="date-label {{item.date===selectedDate?'active-date':''}}" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="selectDay">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="chart-legend"><view class="legend-item"><view class="legend-swatch bar"></view><text>已知奶量</text></view><view class="legend-item"><view class="legend-swatch bar estimated"></view><text>含用户估算量</text></view><view class="legend-item"><text class="legend-symbol">—</text><text>未记录量</text></view></view><text class="sub">点击柱或日期查看逐次记录；奶量暂未计入营养计算。</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">{{selectedDate}} 的喂养记录</view><text wx:if="{{detailUnavailable}}" class="sub">这份历史日报未保存逐次奶量明细，不能用当前记录替代。</text><text wx:elif="{{!records.length}}" class="sub">这一天没有奶量记录。</text><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="milkRecordId" class="feed-row"><view class="feed-copy"><text class="feed-type">{{item.typeLabel}}</text><text class="sub">{{item.volumeText}}</text></view><text class="feed-time">{{item.time}}</text></view></view></block></view>
